/final-screenshot.png

# Raw benchmark sessions stay local: they can contain large event streams,
# screenshots, browser profiles, temporary paths, and copied workspaces.
results/**

# Publish only the curated summaries for the current batch. Superseded batches
# are removed from source control; their raw evidence stays local.
